    // single public test function
    // params: deposit amount (amt) and an address to act as msg.sender via callcontext
    // but we cannot change msg.sender in Solidity; instead we use this contract as the caller
    // so the rule asserts that a small payable deposit does not increase this contract's balance entry in c

